<title>USA: Proffitt's Dec same-store sales flat.</title>
<headline>Proffitt's Dec same-store sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $338.3    $ 244.7	 +38	 flat</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is    5 weeks ended Jan 4, 1997</p>
<p>    Full company name is	Proffitt's Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Total sales of $338.3 million include $100.7 million of sales from the Parisian Division. On a comparable stores basis, excluding Parisian, total company sales were flat with last year for the month.</p>
